IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-LORA-DISTILL-V3.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TEACHER-RANK        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 STUDENT-RANK        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 TOTAL-LAYERS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-DISTILL-V3.
    IF TEACHER-RANK == 0 OR STUDENT-RANK == 0 OR TOTAL-LAYERS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 13400 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TOTAL-LAYERS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
